Show sample image updates in demo mode

PIHUB_DEMO=1 now lists two image updates kept in memory: Sonarr (matched to
the demo service, 3 hours old) and FlareSolverr (no matching service, 26
hours old), so the sidebar and badges can be worked on and screenshotted
without Diun. Dismissing works and lasts until restart.

Files: pihub/demo.py, pihub/__main__.py, tests/test_updates.py
